	'ct_p0' => 'Tsukuri Design Office is based at Studio 4, Foundry Lane 18 in Haverholt. Our general studio hours run Monday to Friday from 09:00 to 18:00. Model shop visits take place on Tuesdays and Thursdays between 10:00 and 16:00, strictly by prior appointment. We are closed on weekends and recognized public holidays. For all project enquiries, discovery workshop bookings, and administrative correspondence, write to studio@tsukuri.example or telephone our studio desk at +00 31 555 0172. Studio manager Paul Moreau reviews all incoming messages and replies within 3 working days.',
	'ct_p1' => 'Arriving at Haverholt, Foundry Lane runs behind the old canal docks. Studio 4 is inside the brick courtyard at number 18, with ground-floor access for deliveries and visitor parking marked beside the model shop doors. If arriving by train, Haverholt central station is a brief taxi ride away. Please ring the Studio 4 buzzer at the main timber gate upon arrival.',
