	'fe_p0' => 'Commercial product development requires strict financial predictability. Tsukuri Design Office provides clear, fixed pricing in euros for every discrete phase of development, enabling product directors and founders to plan their capital expenditure with clarity. We do not use vague starting estimates or obscure hourly billing models. When your project advances into tooling fabrication, prototype sampling, or contract manufacturing, all supplier invoices and tooling costs are paid directly by the client to the factory at cost. We never add agency margins, handling fees, or percentage markups to third-party manufacturing charges.',
	'fe_p2' => 'Every client collaboration begins with our one-day discovery workshop, priced at €2,400. This session allows both teams to interrogate mechanical risks, user constraints, and manufacturing assumptions before substantial capital is committed. If you decide to advance into subsequent development stages—such as field research or concept and foam modeling—the entire €2,400 discovery workshop fee is deducted directly from your next project invoice. This policy ensures that exploring a potential collaboration with our studio represents an immediate, cost-effective investment in your product\'s long-term engineering foundation. To discuss your project, contact studio manager Paul Moreau.',
